# Blackcleave Goblin, a french vanilla creature: cast with Black Lotus mana, its characteristics as printed (power, toughness,
# keywords, colors, types, protection), then attacking Bot2, who has no creatures.
# Haste (CR 702.10b): it attacks the turn it comes under Bot1's control.
# Infect (CR 702.90b): its damage to a player is poison counters, not life loss.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Blackcleave Goblin
Plains x21

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

